### Sample requests - open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension
### and click "Send Request" above each one.
### Local:  @base = http://localhost:7071/api   (no key needed locally)
### Azure:  @base = https://<your-app>.azurewebsites.net/api  and set @key

@base = https://empcomp-deep-func-cwbsfyfdgxc3bkfh.uaenorth-01.azurewebsites.net/api
@key = 

### Health check (anonymous)
GET {{base}}/health

### ---------------- Part A: CRUD ----------------

### A.1 Create an employee without a bonus
POST {{base}}/employees?code={{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Asha",
  "lastName": "Kapoor",
  "departmentId": 2,
  "salary": 64000.50,
  "hireDate": "2025-02-01"
}

### A.1 Validation failure -> 400 with per-field details
POST {{base}}/employees?code={{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "", "salary": -5, "bonus": "lots" }

### A.1 Unknown department -> 400
POST {{base}}/employees?code={{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Test", "lastName": "User", "departmentId": 99, "salary": 50000 }

### A.2 Get one employee
GET {{base}}/employees/1?code={{key}}

### A.2 Get one employee with the Part C default bonus applied (read-time)
GET {{base}}/employees/3?applyDefaultBonus=true&code={{key}}

### A.2 Missing employee -> 404
GET {{base}}/employees/9999?code={{key}}

### A.3 List all employees
GET {{base}}/employees?code={{key}}

### A.3 List employees in one department
GET {{base}}/employees?departmentId=2&code={{key}}

### A.4 Partial update - change only the bonus
PATCH {{base}}/employees/3?code={{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bonus": 7500 }

### A.4 Remove a bonus (explicit null)
PATCH {{base}}/employees/3?code={{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bonus": null }

### A.4 Full replacement
PUT {{base}}/employees/3?code={{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Rohan",
  "lastName": "Mehta",
  "departmentId": 1,
  "salary": 98000,
  "bonus": null,
  "hireDate": "2021-01-18"
}

### A.5 Delete -> 204 (run twice: second time is 404)
DELETE {{base}}/employees/13?code={{key}}

### ---------------- Part B: reports ----------------

### B.1
GET {{base}}/reports/total-bonus?code={{key}}

### B.2
GET {{base}}/reports/employees-without-bonus?code={{key}}

### B.3
GET {{base}}/reports/bonus-percentage?code={{key}}

### B.4
GET {{base}}/reports/departments-bonus-over-average-salary?code={{key}}

### B.5
GET {{base}}/reports/bonus-ranking?code={{key}}

### B.6
GET {{base}}/reports/highest-salary?code={{key}}
